ます！\n是非ともよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@43CTW/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ddd750c/uploads/origins/222ee73d-93c2-45a8-b890-a7a4e600ecca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a53febf2a601c10bae8681e286aefcb9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ddd750c/uploads/origins/222ee73d-93c2-45a8-b890-a7a4e600ecca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a53febf2a601c10bae8681e286aefcb9, https://si.imgix.net/9ddd750c/uploads/origins/222ee73d-93c2-45a8-b890-a7a4e600ecca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95622595002f78e2a523e1dd095efe42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9ddd750c/uploads/origins/222ee73d-93c2-45a8-b890-a7a4e600ecca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc9304e4a08e553d5b7aa5e4b91a9c8b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ミステリアスビューティーセクシーすとがーちゃんをお願いいたしますわ！！！！！！！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@43CTW/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/82734fca/uploads/origins/c320ddd2-95a6-4ac5-93f2-2701ddaff723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f20f2f681fb974dd224081b58e312340", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82734fca/uploads/origins/c320ddd2-95a6-4ac5-93f2-2701ddaff723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f20f2f681fb974dd224081b58e312340, https://si.imgix.net/82734fca/uploads/origins/c320ddd2-95a6-4ac5-93f2-2701ddaff723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3abe7f7c21d0bdb36ebc828b866903 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82734fca/uploads/origins/c320ddd2-95a6-4ac5-93f2-2701ddaff723?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f32bacea950bf55fba4ab30094ad1725 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！\nリクエスト受付再開との連絡を受け飛んでまいりました！\n受けていただけるとありがたいです！\n↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓\nゆーね先生(@ayanepu